translate schinese_rewrite Viscid_Stream_Loop_c06f64a2:

    # "The Chest is empty."
    "宝箱是空的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Viscid_Stream_Loop_cee136cf:

    # "You look inside the chest, there seem to be some items stored in the chest."
    "你查看宝箱内部，里面似乎存放着一些物品。"

translate schinese_rewrite Viscid_Stream_Loop_2daa9371:

    # "You found a slime necklace, 2 pieces of iron and a green ointment."
    "你发现了一条史莱姆项链、2块铁和一瓶绿色药膏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Viscid_Stream_Loop_f5e4bfbd:

    # "You look at the scripture, it seems to be written in an entirely different language."
    "你看向经文，似乎是用一种完全不同的语言写成的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Viscid_Stream_Loop_e5203e12:

    # "You look at the scripture, there seem to be an aching aura surrounding you."
    "你看着经文，周围似乎萦绕着一股令人疼痛的气息。"

translate schinese_rewrite Viscid_Stream_Loop_442effc7:

    # "The ancient scripture is speaking to your mind directly..."
    "古老的经文正直接对你的心灵说话……"

translate schinese_rewrite Viscid_Stream_Loop_45fe11ca:

    # "You hold both sides of your head, the pain in your head grows more unbearable."
    "你捂住头的两侧，头痛变得越来越难以忍受。"

translate schinese_rewrite Viscid_Stream_Loop_e4b12a18:

    # "Suddenly, the aching stops."
    "突然，疼痛停止了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Viscid_Stream_Loop_208cec1f:

    # "You look around, nothing has changed, but your body feels weird."
    "你环顾四周，什么都没有改变，但你的身体感觉很奇怪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Viscid_Stream_Loop_f6c64c6d:

    # "You look at the scripture again... it seems you've learnt a new skill."
    "你再次看向经文……看来你学会了一项新技能。"

translate schinese_rewrite Viscid_Stream_Loop_23cfcc65:

    # "{i}Resolution: Reduce your Lust based on your INT.{/i}"
    "{i}结算：根据你的智力降低淫欲。{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Viscid_Stream_Loop_34be031e:

    # "You follow the dirt path in the Viscid Stream."
    "你沿着黏液溪流中的土路前进。"

translate schinese_rewrite Viscid_Stream_Loop_bc68dbe3:

    # "There's a dense forest ahead of you, but you squeeze your body through tight spots here and there."
    "前方是一片茂密的森林，但你还是挤过一道道狭窄的缝隙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Viscid_Stream_Loop_855f77b4:

    # "After a few minutes, you've finally arrived to somewhere open."
    "几分钟后，你终于来到了一个开阔的地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Viscid_Stream_Loop_985f7add:

    # "You've arrived to another riverside area. Maybe there's something you can find here..."
    "你来到了另一处河畔。也许能在这里找到些什么……"

translate schinese_rewrite Viscid_Stream_Loop_549aa4af:

    # "The door seems to be barred from the other side..."
    "这扇门似乎从另一侧被闩住了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Viscid_Stream_Loop_f4239549:

    # "You push the horizontal plank upwards. The door is now unlocked."
    "你把横木向上推起。门现在解锁了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Viscid_Stream_Loop_34be031e_1:

    # "You follow the dirt path in the Viscid Stream."
    "你沿着黏液溪流中的土路前进。"

translate schinese_rewrite Viscid_Stream_Loop_bc68dbe3_1:

    # "There's a dense forest ahead of you, but you squeeze your body through tight spots here and there."
    "前方是一片茂密的森林，但你还是挤过一道道狭窄的缝隙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Viscid_Stream_Loop_855f77b4_1:

    # "After a few minutes, you've finally arrived to somewhere open."
    "几分钟后，你终于来到了一个开阔的地方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Viscid_Stream_Loop_bf28d22e:

    # "You notice there's a hint of white rock in front of you... it looks... like an abandoned sanctuary..."
    "你注意到前方露出了一角白色岩石……看起来……像是一座废弃的圣所……"

translate schinese_rewrite Viscid_Stream_Loop_f6de1db2:

    # "You enter the viscid stream."
    "你进入了黏液溪流。"

translate schinese_rewrite Viscid_Stream_Hefty_1cbe2585:

    # "The big slime begins to approach you..."
    "那只巨型史莱姆开始朝你逼近……"

translate schinese_rewrite Viscid_Stream_Hefty_626b8d70:

    # e "F-fuck, that's bigger than in the green forest..."
    e "我、我操，比绿森林里的还大……"

translate schinese_rewrite Creek_Thicket_Loop_1cbe2585:

    # "The big slime begins to approach you..."
    "那只巨型史莱姆开始朝你逼近……"

translate schinese_rewrite Creek_Thicket_Loop_626b8d70:

    # e "F-fuck, that's bigger than in the green forest..."
    e "妈的，这比绿林里的那个还大……"

translate schinese_rewrite Creek_Thicket_Loop_9d24fed9:

    # "You peek at the small creature inside the bush."
    "你探头看了看灌木丛里的小家伙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Creek_Thicket_Loop_25826baa:

    # "It seems to be quite friendly towards your presence, despite the infestation of slime around the forest."
    "尽管森林里到处都是史莱姆，它似乎还是相当欢迎你的到来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Creek_Thicket_Loop_dd751c66:

    # "It seems to be a little too excited to see the slimes gone from the area."
    "看到这片区域的史莱姆都消失了，它似乎兴奋得有些过头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Creek_Thicket_Loop_66d2bb1e:

    # "You snoop around its place, you realise there's a few items it's been hoarding for a while."
    "你在它的住处四处窥探，发现它已经偷偷囤了几件物品。"

translate schinese_rewrite Creek_Thicket_Loop_220d6f03:

    # "The little guy seems to be curious about you items too... perhaps you can come to an agreement or some sort..."
    "那个小家伙似乎也对你的物品很好奇……也许你们能想办法达成某种交易……"

translate schinese_rewrite Creek_Thicket_Loop_209b8f2a:

    # "It was too dark to properly see the little guy, and it seems to be too scared to come out."
    "天太黑了，根本看不清那个小家伙，而且它似乎也害怕得不敢出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Creek_Thicket_Loop_e396f693:

    # "Only staring at huge slime in fright..."
    "它只是惊恐地盯着巨大的史莱姆……"

translate schinese_rewrite Creek_Thicket_Loop_11bdcf7c:

    # "Maybe you need to... defeat all the slime in the area to comfort it a little."
    "也许你得……打败这片区域里的所有史莱姆，才能稍微安慰它一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Creek_Thicket_Loop_416421c5:

    # "You pick up the book..."
    "你拿起了这本书……"

translate schinese_rewrite Creek_Thicket_Loop_261d3896:

    # booky "{i}'Botanical Journal of Plants In and Around the Dark Forest: Species, Uses, and Dangers.'\n {b}-y W—t-r A-z-var- {/b}{/i}"
    booky "{i}《暗森林内外植物图鉴：物种、用途与危险》\n {b}-y W—t-r A-z-var- {/b}{/i}"

translate schinese_rewrite Creek_Thicket_Loop_9537f04c:

    # "You sigh as you open the book to the first page. It seems like the writing quality will deteriorate the further you go down the page."
    "你叹了口气，将书翻到第一页。看来越往后读，书里的文字质量就会越来越差。"

translate schinese_rewrite Creek_Thicket_Loop_c0e0b0a6:

    # "It's a bit pathetic to see the one remaining entry at the end, laying loose against the back cover. You pick it up and read it."
    "看到末尾仅剩的那条记录松松地靠在封底上，实在有些可怜。你把它捡起来读了读。"

translate schinese_rewrite Creek_Thicket_Loop_57e53225:

    # "The words have barely faded, so deeply etched are they into the bottom of the page."
    "这些字深深刻在页底，几乎没有褪色。"

translate schinese_rewrite Creek_Thicket_Loop_22e1b3ff:

    # "It is upsetting to think that a large part of this person's thoughts have disappeared, even from their writing."
    "想到这个人的大部分思绪已经消失，甚至连他的文字中也不复存在，实在令人难过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Creek_Thicket_Loop_71c20960:

    # "Only the lucky, and those which were most important to him survived unblemished."
    "只有侥幸留存下来的，以及对他最重要的那些，才完好无损地保存了下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Creek_Thicket_Loop_d708d476:

    # "There is nothing more for you to read right now. You decide to stick the book into your inventory."
    "现在没什么可供你阅读的了。你决定把书收进物品栏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Creek_Thicket_Loop_108496bf:

    # "Perhaps there are more fragments somewhere around here."
    "也许这附近还有更多残页。"

translate schinese_rewrite Creek_Thicket_Loop_17b68e12:

    # msg "The book 'Medicinal Botany, by ???' is now stored in your inventory."
    msg "《药用植物学》，作者：？？？，现已存入你的物品栏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Creek_Thicket_Loop_4c396871:

    # msg "To read the book again, interact with the book in the inventory."
    msg "若要再次阅读这本书，请与物品栏中的书互动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Creek_Thicket_Loop_709c2a3d:

    # "You try to open the chest, but to no avail... Maybe there's something around the area that can unlock the chest..."
    "你试着打开箱子，却毫无结果……也许附近有什么东西能解锁箱子……"

translate schinese_rewrite Creek_Thicket_Loop_cccd0ff3:

    # "You open the chest in front of you, there's a Tribal Spear and 3 pieces of Green Ointment inside."
    "你打开面前的箱子，里面有一把部落长矛和3份绿色药膏。"

translate schinese_rewrite Creek_Thicket_Loop_7b419661:

    # "You put them in your pocket, and continues on your way."
    "你把它们收进口袋，继续赶路。"

translate schinese_rewrite Creek_Thicket_Loop_637a4d96:

    # "You leave the creek thicket along the path ahead of you."
    "你沿着前方的小路离开溪边灌木丛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Creek_Thicket_Hefty_a1f40dc4:

    # "The big slime begins approaching you..."
    "那只巨大的史莱姆开始向你靠近……"

translate schinese_rewrite Creek_Thicket_Hefty_626b8d70:

    # e "F-fuck, that's bigger than in the green forest..."
    e "操，那比绿森林里的还大……"

translate schinese_rewrite Little_Guy_Shopping_50d6e7de:

    # "You take out 3 pieces of carrot, the creature immediately blushes with excitement, it runs towards the back of the bush..."
    "你拿出三根胡萝卜，那生物立刻兴奋得脸红，朝灌木丛后方跑去……"

translate schinese_rewrite Little_Guy_Shopping_4290cd4e:

    # "After mere seconds, it carries two pieces of chestnut in its embrace, and drops it in front of your leg."
    "没过几秒，它怀里抱着两颗栗子回来，丢在你的腿边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Little_Guy_Shopping_b74c28c7:

    # "The little creature greedily drags the carrots in the back, you can hear a few cackle emanating from the direction."
    "那小生物贪婪地把胡萝卜拖到后面，你能听见那边传来几声咯咯笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Little_Guy_Shopping_31fcde7f:

    # "You... don't seem to own enough carrots for the little creature's appetite."
    "看来你拥有的胡萝卜不够满足这小生物的胃口……"

translate schinese_rewrite Little_Guy_Shopping_9d5dbded:

    # "You wave farewell to the little creature, and continues on your journey."
    "你挥手向那小生物告别，继续踏上旅程。"
